# Raw sound downloads from ZapSplat.
#
# These are re-downloadable from zapsplat.com (see context/SOUND_SHORTLIST.md
# for the exact titles) and are superseded by the trimmed, crossfade-looped
# versions in context/sounds/edited/, which are committed. Keeping ~17 MB of
# source MP3s out of the history keeps the repo small.
alarm-project/context/sounds/*.mp3

# Processed audio, working copies.
#
# Every file here is byte-identical to one in gently/assets/sounds/, which is
# the copy that actually ships. Tracking both doubled the repo for nothing.
# The raw sources are ignored above, so this folder is where processing output
# lands before it is copied into the app.
alarm-project/context/sounds/edited/
